["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Build/buildType", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A buildType is a hint that is used to indicate the toolchain, platform, or\ninfrastructure that the build was invoked on.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SbomType/analyzed", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "SBOM generated through analysis of artifacts (e.g., executables, packages, containers, and virtual machine images) after its build. Such analysis generally requires a variety of heuristics. In some contexts, this may also be referred to as a \"3rd party\" SBOM.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
